 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.4491064491064491, "x1": 0.41208791208791207, "y1": 0.48329448329448327}, {"text": "General Instructions Total marks - 15", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5881895881895882, "x1": 0.6208791208791209, "y1": 0.5982905982905983}, {"text": "* Working time \u2014 30 minutes * Attempt Questions 1-6", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6107226107226107, "x1": 0.6758241758241759, "y1": 0.6231546231546231}, {"text": "including reading time and", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.6285936285936286, "x1": 0.34725274725274724, "y1": 0.6410256410256411}, {"text": "listening time", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.6464646464646465, "x1": 0.24065934065934066, "y1": 0.6588966588966589}, {"text": "* Write using black or blue pen", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6674436674436675, "x1": 0.37142857142857144, "y1": 0.6798756798756799}, {"text": "Black pen is preferred", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.6845376845376845, "x1": 0.3098901098901099, "y1": 0.6977466977466977}, {"text": "* Write your Centre Number and", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.7062937062937062, "x1": 0.38351648351648354, "y1": 0.7187257187257188}, {"text": "Student Number at the top of", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.7233877233877234, "x1": 0.36813186813186816, "y1": 0.7365967365967366}, {"text": "this page", "x0": 0.13186813186813187, "y0": 0.7420357420357421, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.7544677544677545}], [{"text": "Total marks 15", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.26373626373626374, "y1": 0.09090909090909091}, {"text": "Attempt Questions 1-6", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.09712509712509712, "x1": 0.31648351648351647, "y1": 0.11033411033411034}, {"text": "Answer the questions in the spaces provided. These spaces provide guidance for the expected", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.13053613053613053, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.14374514374514374}, {"text": "length of response.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.14685314685314685, "x1": 0.2714285714285714, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "In your answers you will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.17793317793317792, "x1": 0.5879120879120879, "y1": 0.19036519036519037}, {"text": "m= demonstrate understanding of the relationship between language, text, audience and", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.19735819735819735, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "purpose", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.21678321678321677, "x1": 0.22967032967032966, "y1": 0.22688422688422688}, {"text": "The Listening Task", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.26728826728826727, "x1": 0.2846153846153846, "y1": 0.2804972804972805}, {"text": "You are about to hear an extract from a live recording of a presentation. In this extract,", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.29215229215229216, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "sound expert Julian Treasure talks about the importance of listening.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3123543123543124, "x1": 0.6725274725274726, "y1": 0.32556332556332557}, {"text": "Before you hear the recording you will have two minutes to read the questions printed", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.34032634032634035, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.35353535353535354}, {"text": "in this paper.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.35742035742035744, "x1": 0.22197802197802197, "y1": 0.3706293706293706}, {"text": "As you are listening to the recording, follow the questions. You may write notes if you", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3853923853923854, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.3986013986013986}, {"text": "wish in the Candidate\u2019s Notes spaces provided on pages 2-4. Anything you write in", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4024864024864025, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.4156954156954157}, {"text": "the Candidate\u2019s Notes spaces will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4188034188034188, "x1": 0.5318681318681319, "y1": 0.432012432012432}, {"text": "You will hear the recording, then the questions will be read aloud. You will hear the", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.44755244755244755, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.46076146076146074}, {"text": "recording a SECOND time, and then you will be given time to write the answers.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.46386946386946387, "x1": 0.778021978021978, "y1": 0.47707847707847706}, {"text": "You now have two minutes to read the questions.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4926184926184926, "x1": 0.5153846153846153, "y1": 0.5058275058275058}, {"text": "Question 1 (1 mark)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5423465423465423, "x1": 0.2868131868131868, "y1": 0.5547785547785548}, {"text": "What is the definition of listening? 1", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.5757575757575758, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.5889665889665889}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.5967032967032967, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "9287310054 |", "x0": 0.7769230769230769, "y0": 0.037296037296037296, "x1": 0.9307692307692308, "y1": 0.059052059052059055}, {"text": "Question 2 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09324009324009325}, {"text": "What reasons does he give for why \u2018we are losing our listening\u2019? 2", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11344211344211344, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.12665112665112666}, {"text": "Question 3 (2 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.2773892773892774, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.2898212898212898}, {"text": "Explain what is meant by, \u2018conscious listening always creates understanding\u2019. 2", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3108003108003108, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.32400932400932403}, {"text": "Question 4 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.47474747474747475, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.48717948717948717}, {"text": "How are sound effects used in the presentation? 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5081585081585082, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.5213675213675214}, {"text": "Please turn over", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.7466977466977467, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.7567987567987567}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.5967032967032967, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}], [{"text": "Question 5 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.09324009324009325}, {"text": "In what ways is listening improved by using \u2018RASA\u2019? 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11344211344211344, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.12665112665112666}, {"text": "Question 6 (4 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3628593628593629, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.3752913752913753}, {"text": "How does the speaker convey the importance of listening? 4", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3962703962703963, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.4094794094794095}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44285714285714284, "y0": 0.7801087801087802, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.7933177933177933}, {"text": "NOTES: These notes will NOT be marked.", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.822066822066822, "x1": 0.5967032967032967, "y1": 0.8321678321678322}, {"text": "(\u00a9 2014 Board of Studies, Teaching and Educational Standards NSW", "x0": 0.3373626373626374, "y0": 0.9658119658119658, "x1": 0.6604395604395604, "y1": 0.9728049728049728}]]